272
00:18:49,241 --> 00:18:52,240
Compare that to the infantry musket

273
00:18:52,241 --> 00:18:55,240
of the 17th century with 4,000 jewels.

274
00:18:55,241 --> 00:18:58,240
And one can easily see why plate armor

275
00:18:58,241 --> 00:19:01,240
went out of fashion when it did.

276
00:19:01,241 --> 00:19:05,240
In the mid-1300s, rudimentary firearms

277
00:19:05,241 --> 00:19:06,240
started appearing on the battlefields of Europe.

278
00:19:06,241 --> 00:19:07,240
battlefields of Europe.

