00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:28,240
Eventually, the firearm was fitted with a short dagger, the bayonet, and used as a staff weapon,

282
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:31,240
further increasing the versatility of the gun.

283
00:19:34,240 --> 00:19:36,240
Basically, loading the gun doesn't change.

284
00:19:36,241 --> 00:19:38,240
from the time they're invented until the time

