00:19:59,241 --> 00:20:04,240
introduced in the early 1800s helped to speed up the firing process.

292
00:20:04,241 --> 00:20:06,240
But kill the kill,

293
00:20:06,241 --> 00:20:09,240
Killing could still be made faster.

