00:20:09,241 --> 00:20:12,740
In 1884, the American, Hiram Maxim,

295
00:20:12,741 --> 00:20:15,240
invented the first true automatic machine gun.

296
00:20:19,240 --> 00:20:23,240
The Maxim gun would soon be used by every modern army in the world.

297
00:20:23,241 --> 00:20:35,240
During World War I,

298
00:20:35,241 --> 00:20:38,240
Machine guns produced horrific battle casualties.

299
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:44,240
Appalled at the losses, the French general, Auguste Louis-Adrian,

300
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:47,240
