314
00:22:10,240 --> 00:22:13,240
The British were close behind, with a design of their own.

315
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:17,240
When the U.S. entered the war in 1917,

316
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:21,240
it adopted the British tin hat helmet known as the Brody

317
00:22:21,241 --> 00:22:24,240
and designated it the M1917.

318
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:30,240
Desperate to protect soldiers,

319
00:22:30,241 --> 00:22:33,240
