334
00:23:38,241 --> 00:23:40,240
The human body hasn't changed, really.

335
00:23:40,241 --> 00:23:42,240
It's just the weapons that are used against it.

336
00:23:42,241 --> 00:23:46,240
So one can draw on old forms of armor design,

337
00:23:46,241 --> 00:23:48,240
which were quite effective.

338
00:23:48,241 --> 00:23:52,240
It's easy to see the historic influence

339
00:23:52,241 --> 00:23:54,240
on these experimental helmets.

340
00:23:54,241 --> 00:23:58,240
A few designs were seriously considered.

341
00:23:58,241 --> 00:24:00,240
Dean's helmets have a few designs were seriously considered.

342
00:24:00,241 --> 00:24:04,240
Dean's helmets, however, never saw active duty.

343
00:24:04,241 --> 00:24:09,240
The war ended before the military had time to fully test and implement them.

344
00:24:09,241 --> 00:24:21,240
Helmets helped reduce casualties in the trenches, but one weapon seemed custom made for this style of warfare.

345
00:24:21,241 --> 00:24:28,240
Nobody went to war carrying festoon with hand grenades in 1914.

346
00:24:28,241 --> 00:24:33,240
by the end of the First World War, their standard equipment.

347
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:40,240
Hand grenades in the form of black powder-filled iron balls

