00:24:58,240 --> 00:25:05,240
But the grenade's ability to reach entrenched positions spurred armies to toss an old idea around.

352
00:25:05,241 --> 00:25:15,240
For the World War I soldier, it was just one more thing he had to carry.

353
00:25:15,241 --> 00:25:23,240
At the beginning of the First World War, there started a process, which continues right up to the present day,

354
00:25:23,241 --> 00:25:27,240
which tries to make the soldier able to carry with the soldier,

